 * on a whole-word basis ({@code ST}&rarr;{@code STREET}, {@code RD}&rarr;{@code ROAD},
 * {@code AVE}&rarr;{@code AVENUE}). The result is idempotent, so normalizing an already-normalized
 * value leaves it unchanged.
